/-! The head part of a phase of 1RB0LF_0LC0RE_0RA1LD_1LB0LD_0RA1RC_1LA---, cut at the excursions into the tail; written by `py/gen_resetmap.py` (bbtools.symtm.prove).  Each theorem is a run for every value of its parameters and every tail.  The composition is in `ResetMap.lean`. -/

set_option maxRecDepth 20000

